<title>USA: Norfolk Southern Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Norfolk Southern Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.60		    $1.37</p>
<p> Net		 200,500		  176,900</p>
<p> Oper revs	 1,179,900		1,155,200</p>
<p>	     MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $6.09		    $5.44</p>
<p> Net		 770,400		  712,700</p>
<p> Revs		4,700,000		4,668,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1995 figures include costs of an early retirement program, which reduced net income by $20.4 million or $0.16 a share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
